      "post_subject": "MBDCG using TEA",
      "content_md": "Hello! Help me please... I've found a recipe of MBDCG. Could i use triethanolamine instead of TMG in this recipe? \n\n[http://holowiki.org/wiki/MBDCG](http://holowiki.org/wiki/MBDCG)\n\nP.s. Sorry if it sounds stupid.",
